  unitName: Paladin Crusader Sodis
  unitId: 50386
  unitNumber: 1234
  description: Slain in a duel with his younger brother, Sodis bore deep scars on
    his soul. Having lived and died for himself, he lost everything including the
    chance to profess love for his cherished lady, leading him to burn with anger
    at the gods. At long last his tortured soul, long wracked with chaotic emotion,
    was shattered and sublimated. His thoughts screamed out across time and space,
    solidifying into a will to be trusted by his dear ones. Leaving his poignant
    past behind, Sodis strove forward, silently bearing the crushing weight of his
    sorrow and regret.
  summonDesc: At last, at the very end, [[Phantom Victor Zephyr|someone]] I can finally
    trust with everything. Though I'm sure they find it a burden.
  fusionDesc: No punishment is too great, if it can save a life! For redemption,
    I will gladly sacrifice myself.
  evoDesc: My sorrow and regret know no bounds.<br>Yet I still believe!<br>Humanity
    verily seeks the path of righteousness!
  element: 5
  rarity: 6
